Fixed: IBTK::FACPreconditioner now maintains composite correction equations
through V-cycles with presmoothing and repeated W- and F-cycle visits.
F-cycles use a recursive F visit followed by a V visit. Single-level cycles
support nonzero levels; multilevel W/F require level zero. Multilevel V-cycles
with presmoothing support nonzero coarsest levels when caller solution storage
also exists on all lower levels. Ghost filling may modify the preceding level.
